{"logId": "0822cee4-c19a-46d2-b056-9d25f1e88cdd", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [371, 120, 943, 167], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[371.0, 120.0], [943.0, 120.0], [943.0, 167.0], [371.0, 167.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、关注孩子心理健康，不因某件事或不理解的东西造成孩子长期的心理阴影", "block_bbox": [391, 230, 1288, 266], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[391.0, 230.0], [1288.0, 230.0], [1288.0, 266.0], [391.0, 266.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、保持良好的沟通，及时给予孩子正确的观念引导", "block_bbox": [392, 275, 999, 310], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[392.0, 275.0], [999.0, 275.0], [999.0, 310.0], [392.0, 310.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、培养孩子自信的状态", "block_bbox": [393, 320, 686, 354], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[393.0, 320.0], [686.0, 320.0], [686.0, 354.0], [393.0, 354.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）向孩子说明，他本身已经很好了，没必要表现自己或证明自己", "block_bbox": [409, 364, 1183, 401], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[409.0, 364.0], [1183.0, 364.0], [1183.0, 401.0], [409.0, 401.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）对于学习，能力大于成绩，十分是进步、一分也是进步，告诉孩子“你不笨，只是还没有学会而已”", "block_bbox": [409, 409, 1614, 446], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[409.0, 409.0], [1614.0, 409.0], [1614.0, 446.0], [409.0, 446.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）不对孩子的失败表示沮丧，对孩子说“我也不会干这个”或“我以前也不会”", "block_bbox": [410, 454, 1353, 491], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[410.0, 454.0], [1353.0, 454.0], [1353.0, 491.0], [410.0, 491.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）当孩子面对难为情的事时，要告诉孩子“这很正常”“这是自然的事”", "block_bbox": [409, 499, 1275, 536], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[409.0, 499.0], [1275.0, 499.0], [1275.0, 536.0], [409.0, 536.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（5）谨慎惩罚孩子，除非犯了道德品质的问题", "block_bbox": [409, 545, 948, 581], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[409.0, 545.0], [948.0, 545.0], [948.0, 581.0], [409.0, 581.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、给孩子良好的安全教育", "block_bbox": [394, 590, 711, 625], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[394.0, 590.0], [711.0, 590.0], [711.0, 625.0], [394.0, 625.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）教育孩子做人做事的底线（不违背法律、不伤害自己和他人等）", "block_bbox": [407, 635, 1193, 671], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[407.0, 635.0], [1193.0, 635.0], [1193.0, 671.0], [407.0, 671.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）培养孩子安全意识、安全技能，让孩子学会保护自己（防丢失、交通安全、基本消防安全技能、用电用气安全常识等）", "block_bbox": [394, 680, 1602, 760], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[393.6724548339844, 680.0428466796875], [1600.979248046875, 675.04150390625], [1601.3062744140625, 753.998779296875], [393.99951171875, 759.0001220703125]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "·让孩子记住父母的大名、电话及家庭住址；或将这些信息制成卡片或手环，外出时让孩子随身携带", "block_bbox": [408, 770, 1573, 807], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[408.0, 770.0], [1573.0, 770.0], [1573.0, 807.0], [408.0, 807.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "● 小学生安全守则：平安成长比成功更重要；背心、裤衩覆盖的地方不许别人摸；生命第一，财产第二；小秘密要告诉妈妈；拒绝陌生人的饮料、糖果、礼物和搂抱；不与陌生人说话；遇到危险可以打破玻璃，", "block_bbox": [393, 817, 1608, 902], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[393.0, 817.0], [1608.0, 817.0], [1608.0, 902.0], [393.0, 902.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[65]", "block_bbox": [966, 969, 1021, 996], "block_id": 14, "block_order": null, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[966.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 995.0], [966.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8967940807342529, "coordinate": [371, 120, 943, 167], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[371.0, 120.0], [943.0, 120.0], [943.0, 167.0], [371.0, 167.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8542989492416382, "coordinate": [391, 230, 1288, 266], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[391.0, 230.0], [1288.0, 230.0], [1288.0, 266.0], [391.0, 266.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8477138876914978, "coordinate": [392, 275, 999, 310], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[392.0, 275.0], [999.0, 275.0], [999.0, 310.0], [392.0, 310.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7118307948112488, "coordinate": [393, 320, 686, 354], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[393.0, 320.0], [686.0, 320.0], [686.0, 354.0], [393.0, 354.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8635228276252747, "coordinate": [409, 364, 1183, 401], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[409.0, 364.0], [1183.0, 364.0], [1183.0, 401.0], [409.0, 401.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8848764896392822, "coordinate": [409, 409, 1614, 446], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[409.0, 409.0], [1614.0, 409.0], [1614.0, 446.0], [409.0, 446.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.869912326335907, "coordinate": [410, 454, 1353, 491], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[410.0, 454.0], [1353.0, 454.0], [1353.0, 491.0], [410.0, 491.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8613740801811218, "coordinate": [409, 